<Positioned left="522" top="354" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">有效光到这一深度附近基本消失</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="378.3" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">『深海』通常从这里算起</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="418"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S02 / S09]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="500" top="476" width="460" height="168"><Container width="460" height="168" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="496"><Text fontSize="18" color="#2FA79E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">谁的粮仓</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="530" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">绝大多数商业渔业集中在这里</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="554.3" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">海龟与受保护海洋哺乳动物常在此出没</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="612"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S02]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="500" top="668" width="460" height="214"><Container width="460" height="214" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="688"><Text fontSize="18" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">体积观感（自行计算）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="722" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">200 m 只占平均深度 3,682 m 的 5.4%；</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="746.3" width="416"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">在 02 号同比尺上仅约 33 px 高 —— 观感最容易被高估</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="522" top="850"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S01 / calc]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1120" width="880" height="180"><Container width="880" height="180" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
